cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: >-
  If you use this software, cite this repository and the methods relevant to
  your use. Bibliographic entries for the principal dependency, evaluation
  reference, and related systems are included below.
title: "GICP-GNSS Odom Localizer"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "GICP-GNSS Odom Localizer project"
    alias: "KariControl"
    website: "https://github.com/KariControl"
abstract: >-
  A prior-map-free ROS 2 planar LiDAR-IMU-GNSS localization stack with strict
  deskew, scan-to-scan odometry, optional isolated rolling-submap outputs, GNSS
  anchoring and bounded outage recovery, and an optional Autoware
  localization-interface adapter.
repository-code: "https://github.com/KariControl/gicp_gnss_odom_localizer"
url: "https://github.com/KariControl/gicp_gnss_odom_localizer"
license: "Apache-2.0"
keywords:
  - "ROS 2"
  - "LiDAR-inertial odometry"
  - "GNSS localization"
  - "Generalized-ICP"
  - "Autoware"
